  "id": 352,
  "description": "# Monkeybusiness\n\nGreetings, brave adventurer!\nNice to meet you.\n\n#### Who are we? 🐒🎩\nWe are ***Monkeybusiness***, a guild that strives to grow stronger together, by supporting eachother and working towards the same goals, we aim to improve both - our members and the guild as a whole.\n    \n\n#### Important before applying ✔️:\n- be active in raids, challenges and in upcoming assaults (conquest)!\n- participation in discord is required\n- minimum combat level 80\n- inactivity for more than a week without notice may result in removal from the guild\n\n    \n#### What we offer &amp; where are we heading ✨?\n- daily raids cl 80⚔:\n    - raid 1: 20.00 CET\n    - raid 2: 21:10 CET\n\nWhen world boss is around this dates, we consider to time it a few minutes around.\n- (during events =&gt; 19.30 / 20:00 / 20:30 CET)\n- active conquest banner 👑 (raidplanning is adaptable and is announced in discord and  within the game)\n    \n\n#### Where do we stand now 🔥?\n\nWe have started participating in assaults, while we are not yet able to compete with the leading guilds, our goal is to grow stronger - step by step - together!\n\nRight now ***Monkeybusiness*** is built only by a few enthusiastic members and their alts, now we want to change that and attack!\n\nIf you feel adressed by this, we might be looking for you!👀🧐\nSo... what are you waiting for?\n\n#### Communication 💬\nApply and join ***Monkeybusiness*** and become part of the journey, ideally first via discord!\n\n=&gt; https://discord.gg/WDQE6EWBU",
